{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEP","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"西番雅书","commonName":"西番雅书","title":"西番雅书","order":36,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"98f8dfeb620c73641ccea72d07fa22d2f625c270eca8d5133c42650f815febd2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":52},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["当犹大王亚们的儿子约西亚在位的时候，耶和华的话临到希西家的玄孙，亚玛利雅的曾孙，基大利的孙子，古示的儿子西番雅。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华审判的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必从地上除灭万类。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必除灭人和牲畜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与空中的鸟、海里的鱼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及绊脚石和恶人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必将人从地上剪除。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我必伸手攻击犹大","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和耶路撒冷的一切居民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必从这地方剪除所剩下的巴力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并基玛林的名和祭司，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与那些在房顶上敬拜天上万象的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并那些敬拜耶和华指着他起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又指着玛勒堪起誓的，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与那些转去不跟从耶和华的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和不寻求耶和华也不访问他的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你要在主耶和华面前静默无声，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华的日子快到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华已经预备祭物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将他的客分别为圣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到了我—耶和华献祭的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必惩罚首领和王子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并一切穿外邦衣服的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到那日，我必惩罚一切跳过门槛、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将强暴和诡诈得来之物充满主人房屋的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：当那日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从鱼门必发出悲哀的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从二城发出哀号的声音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从山间发出大破裂的响声。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玛革提施的居民哪，你们要哀号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为迦南的商民都灭亡了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡搬运银子的都被剪除。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，我必用灯巡查耶路撒冷；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必惩罚那些如酒在渣滓上澄清的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们心里说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必不降福，也不降祸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的财宝必成为掠物；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的房屋必变为荒场。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必建造房屋，却不得住在其内；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽种葡萄园，却不得喝所出的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华的大日临近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"临近而且甚快，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是耶和华日子的风声；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"勇士必痛痛地哭号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日是忿怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是急难困苦的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是荒废凄凉的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是黑暗幽冥、密云乌黑的日子，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是吹角呐喊的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要攻击坚固城和高大的城楼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"我必使灾祸临到人身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们行走如同瞎眼的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为得罪了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的血必倒出如灰尘；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的肉必抛弃如粪土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当耶和华发怒的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的金银不能救他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的忿怒如火必烧灭全地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毁灭这地的一切居民，而且大大毁灭。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ZEP/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/HAB/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}